(text "USB/BOOT/RESET run over the supplied FPC to the kit adapter.\nThey are NOT on the 18 side socket contacts. Never substitute a\nbare ESP32-S3-MINI-1 or ESP32-S3-Zero into this footprint.\nCS=GPIO2, MOSI=GPIO1; bottom five pads NOT used.\nGPIO38 RGB OFF. No underside pads soldered.\nStrapping pins and internal PSRAM signals have no carrier load." (at 20 150 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "efb60685-ee64-57c2-9fc4-d3f511c1e275"))
