(text "OFF-BOARD KIT ADAPTER (PREASSEMBLED; INCLUDED IN ACCESSORY BOM)" (at 20 198 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f7f27e4e-4509-5790-8012-7a559b13a3e3"))
(text "Tiny FPC L1: 1=GND,2=USB_D-,3=USB_D+,4=GND,5=BOOT(GPIO0),6=RESET(EN),7=VBUS,8=GND.\nUse the matching Waveshare adapter + supplied FPC; do not improvise cable orientation.\nAdapter contains USB-C, two CC 5.1k resistors, BOOT/RESET and power LED.\nTiny contains ME6217 regulator, USB power-blocking diode,22R USB resistors,BOOT/EN pullups.\nUSB data does not traverse the carrier. Adapter schematic shows no dedicated USB ESD array.\nUSB path and input inrush remain vendor-board dependent; hot plugging only at USB-C.\nDisconnect power before changing the FPC. Secure adapter/FPC so cable pull cannot stress lands." (at 20 214 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "231f7101-ca62-507d-872d-44e961505c92"))
(text "4kSPS/channel,21bytes/DRDY=84,000bytes/s. SPI mode1 proposed4MHz:42us/frame,250us period.\nDMA/ring buffer + binary framing + sequence/overflow counters; sustained capture test required.\nRF and RGB OFF during initial EMG acquisition. PC runs ML. This carrier contains no firmware." (at 20 266 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "50322a12-2d43-566d-9706-e888aaf53154"))
)